OL,3,GNEWSARepeat term-time holiday mum fears
OL,4,A#1k fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother of four fears she will be
OL,7,Ffined just under #1,000 for taking her
OL,8,Fchildren out of school for a second
OL,9,Ftime to go on holiday.
OL,11,FHannah, 34, who runs beach cafe The
OL,12,FBoathouse at North Landing in
OL,13,FBridlington, was fined #480 for taking
OL,14,Fher children out of school in 2025, and
OL,15,Fhad them off for a holiday again last
OL,16,Fmonth.
OL,18,FShe said: "The council need to
OL,19,Funderstand that for some workers, such
OL,20,Fas people in hospitality or NHS
OL,21,Fworkers, we can't just take time off
OL,22,Fduring the summer holidays."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
