OL,3,GNEWSARepeat term-time holiday mum fears
OL,4,A#1k fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Department for
OL,7,FEducation said term-time holidays
OL,8,F"place the burden on teachers to
OL,9,Fsupport missed learning and affect the
OL,10,Fentire class."
